OL,3,GNEWSAOptions for the future of county's
OL,4,Acoast laid out
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour visions for the future of
OL,7,FLincolnshire's coastline have been
OL,8,Foutlined amid predictions that up to
OL,9,F85% of the defences along the county's
OL,10,Fcoast could be ineffective by 2040.
OL,12,FThey range from completely renewing the
OL,13,Fdefences, to part-renewing them, to
OL,14,Fdoing nothing and letting nature take
OL,15,Fits course.
OL,17,FIn a meeting with councillors, Chris
OL,18,FMiller, Lincolnshire County Council's
OL,19,Fhead of environment, said the coast was
OL,20,Ffacing pressure from "ageing assets,
OL,21,Frising sea levels, intensification of
OL,22,Fstorms and limitations of funding".
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
